    {"slug":"chicken","name_zh":"鸡","name_en":"Chicken","category":"passive","health":4,"attack_note":"不主动攻击。","behavior_note":"会下蛋、缓慢下落（受重力影响减弱）；可用种子吸引与繁殖。","spawn_note":"生成于亮度等级 ≥ 9 的草方块上，随村庄一同出现。","breeding_note":"喂食任意种子可繁殖；鸡蛋有概率孵化出小鸡。","dimensions":["overworld"],"biomes_note":"常见于草地与村庄。","summary":"提供鸡肉与羽毛，鸡蛋可孵化或用于烘焙。","supported_versions":["1.0+"],"source_url":"https://minecraft.wiki/w/Chicken","data_version":"wiki-2026-10","last_verified_at":"2026-10-18T00:00:00Z","sort_order":4},
