    {"slug":"iron_golem","name_zh":"铁傀儡","name_en":"Iron Golem","category":"neutral","health":100,"attack_note":"近战攻击造成高额伤害与强力击退。","behavior_note":"受攻击后反击；自然生成的铁傀儡保护村民。","spawn_note":"由村庄自然生成，或用 4 个铁块 + 1 个南瓜 / 南瓜灯搭建。","dimensions":["overworld"],"biomes_note":"村庄。","summary":"村庄守护者，掉落铁锭与虞美人。","supported_versions":["1.0+"],"source_url":"https://minecraft.wiki/w/Iron_Golem","data_version":"wiki-2026-10","last_verified_at":"2026-10-18T00:00:00Z","sort_order":23},
