    {"slug":"enderman","name_zh":"末影人","name_en":"Enderman","category":"neutral","health":40,"attack_note":"被直视或攻击后瞬移并近战攻击，伤害较高。","behavior_note":"中立型：被玩家直视（准星对准头部）会转为敌对；可瞬移、搬动方块。","spawn_note":"生成于主世界 / 下界 / 末地的低亮度区域。","dimensions":["overworld","nether","end"],"biomes_note":"任意亮度等级 ≤ 7 的区域。","summary":"可瞬移的中立生物，掉落末影珍珠。","supported_versions":["1.0+"],"source_url":"https://minecraft.wiki/w/Enderman","data_version":"wiki-2026-10","last_verified_at":"2026-10-18T00:00:00Z","sort_order":26},
